/* Sway — zh-Hans. Keys are the English text. */

"Start wrapping up what you're doing." = "开始收尾手头的工作吧。";
"Start now" = "立即开始";
"+%d min" = "+%d 分钟";
"Break in %d:%02d" = "%d:%02d 后休息";
"Breathe in slowly. Breathe out even slower." = "慢慢吸气，再更慢地呼气。";
"Nothing on that screen is going anywhere. You can rest." = "屏幕上的东西不会跑掉，你可以休息一下。";
"Look at something far away and let your eyes soften." = "看看远处，让眼睛放松。";
"Roll your shoulders back. Unclench your jaw." = "向后转转肩膀，放松下颌。";
